    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57146" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηπ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rear in a garden</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάχανα,
